  "markdown": "# The Legend of “Use the task/subagent tool to launch an explore subagent with this task: 'Map…”\n\n*A party of two · 26s · 41.6k tokens*\n\nThe Guildmaster took up the quest alone: “Use the task/subagent tool to launch an explore subagent with this task: 'Map how…”.\n\n## I. The Guildmaster at the Quest Board\n\n*0:00–0:26 (26s) · 26.1k tokens*\n\n\n---\n\n> \\`createSession\\` constructs session data (\\`src/session.ts:1\\`), \\`readSession\\` maps a token to a session (\\`src/session.ts:5\\`), and \\`requireSession\\` enforces it by throwing when absent (\\`src/middleware.ts:3\\`), with no persistence or calls…\n\n*The quest was done in 26s; the loot is home and the hearth is warm.*\n",
